ds to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-20T19:15:09-08:00","id":1547171,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> <br /> I read that in '94. I was not appalled, but I felt it wasn't a good fit for Cyberpunk. I ran one game. I did enjoy the lethality of the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-19T11:01:45-08:00","id":1548590,"title":"","content":"AD&amp;D 2E (my favorite iteration of the game, bar none, currently running),<br /> <br /> Savage Worlds (my go-to &quot;generic system&quot;, and also have some awesome campaign settings).<br /> <br /> Plus, some classics, such as Shadowrun 4e, Call of Cthulhu, Star Wars d6, Traveller, and Pendragon.<br /> <br /> Mutants &amp; Masterminds is also one of my favorite super-heroes RPGs, and Paranoia still remains my favorite humorous RPG to this day,<br /> <br /> I also like many of the OSR games, such as Castles &amp; Crusades, OSEssentials, ACKS, and Hyperborea,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28735-greywolf76","name":"Greywolf76","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28735_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"43"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-21T04:20:29-08:00","id":1548664,"title":"","content":"Big Eyes Small Mouth (any edition)<br /> AD&amp;D 2e<br /> D&amp;D 3.5/Pathfinder 1e<br /> Boot Hill 2e<br /> Twilight 2000<br /> <br /> I need to get back into D&amp;D 5e as well, tbh.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-03-06T17:36:55-08:00","id":1549036,"title":"","content":"I'm glad that I picked up Cyberpunk Red core book and found it engaging, though not having magic or aliens is not something I'm used to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https:/